# AssistU2Win — App Environment Background

## Single source of truth

`app/globals.css` — see also **locked palette** in `assistu2win-app-environment-palette.mdc`.

- `--bg-canvas` — `linear-gradient` (`--bg1` → `--bg2` → `--bg3`) + top-right `radial-gradient` (`--accent-glow`)
- Utility: `.midnight-canvas-gradient` on `body` in `app/layout.tsx`
- Optional: `.midnight-canvas-sheen` for extra top lift (`--ambient-sheen`)

## Required usage

- Root `body`: `.midnight-canvas-gradient`
- Public intake backdrop: `midnight-canvas-gradient` class (via `midnightBackdrop` in `midnight-silk-theme.ts`)
- Dashboard shell: `APP_SHELL_BG` stays transparent — do not block the body gradient

## Forbidden (legacy)

- Plum ombre stops: `#352a42`, `#1a1524`, `#07040b` as canvas
- Flat legacy diagonals: `#141A30`, `#0E1222`, `#090B15`
- Inline full-page background hex on new screens

## Scope

- **Colors/background tokens only** — do not change layout, cards, buttons, or typography when applying this rule.
